  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>tr_publish_model - loads the Credit Card fraud model into the running H2O scoring service, replacing the
one it holds.
Needs the service (C:/ML/start-h2o-service.ps1) and a Credit Card run (train_model_output/gbm_fraud).
Parameters: SERVICE_URL (http://127.0.0.1:54400), MODEL_ID (gbm_fraud), CREDIT_CARD_DIR (the Credit
Card lab folder).

1. Generate rows: one row, to start the Python step.
2. py-publish_model: Python Executor, h2o-env's python.exe; h2o.connect to the service, remove
   MODEL_ID if loaded, h2o.load_model from CREDIT_CARD_DIR; Variables to fields.
3. wlog-published: Write to log, the result.

Shipped data: model_id gbm_fraud, algorithm gbm, trees 150; replaced no the first time, yes after.</note>
